{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Process initiation and the first explicit verification step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if they have not been completed, you should flag it and send a reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "XOR split on completion status with a negative guard correctly triggering the flag-and-reminder action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive guard continues the main flow upon completion; converge rejoins the conditional path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Second verification step directly matches the source instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n15",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Second XOR split with a negative guard correctly triggering the secondary reminder action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive guard proceeds once reports are confirmed done; converge merges flows."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the Referee Reports have been completed, you can move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Step split into two equivalent actions preserves the intended interview-organization behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the interviews, it is necessary to receive feedback from the interview candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the post-interview feedback collection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Action and branching node together capture the requirement check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n9",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative guard correctly routes to coordinating the second selection round when the test is unnecessary."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive guard routes to the nested specialist check and its associated decision gateway."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard accurately models the condition for external scheduling."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative guard correctly triggers internal test completion when no specialist is needed."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Converges conditional paths, executes the final ranking request, and terminates the process."
    }
  ],
